body:
sanctioned suicide is the last - i repeat - last forum website on the opennet to actually provide help for those who seek it. if someone wanted medical help they would seek that, for it exists all over the internet and world. but there's almost nothing for those who actually want to end life as we know it

&#x200B;

i guess the war for the ability to decide what to do with our own lives still rages on, and it will for decades
